msgid "Used by \"Preferred language only\" and by MP4, which keeps one track. Audio description tracks are skipped. Without a match the first track is recorded."
msgstr "Úsáideann “An teanga is fearr leat amháin” í, agus MP4, a choinníonn rian amháin. Scipeáiltear rianta le cur síos fuaime. Mura bhfuil meaitseáil ann taifeadtar an chéad rian."

